        ("BEGINNER", "What does ofstream out('data.txt'); create?", ["A read-only stream", "An output file stream tied to data.txt, which is created or truncated", "A memory stream", "A vector of bytes"], "B", "The ofstream constructor opens data.txt for writing, creating the file if needed and truncating any existing content."),
